    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509660/extras/overview.gif?t=1741117988\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a tense <strong>2.5D Point-and-Click Horror</strong> where critical thinking and strategy will help you solidify your survival.\u00a0Your mission: You must navigate through a dark cave featuring a unique <strong>6x6 grid map system</strong> to find and kill the yeti. Explore the cave and avoid dangers while using the limited resources to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509660/extras/2ccea4de5f0c36b2eb40a39e4787caca.poster.avif?t=1741117988\" width=800 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509660/extras/2ccea4de5f0c36b2eb40a39e4787caca.webm?t=1741117988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509660/extras/2ccea4de5f0c36b2eb40a39e4787caca.mp4?t=1741117988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric 2.5D Point-and-Click experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dark cave with a 6x6 grid system with only a limited light source</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely randomized experiences and locations every run to keep the game fresh</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game time is limited to 5 minutes to emphasize strategy whilst under pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And many more features to come</strong>, like a speed run timer to save your best hunting times!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CAN YOU HUNT THE YETI BEFORE IT HUNTS YOU?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509660/extras/overview.gif?t=1741117988\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a tense <strong>2.5D Point-and-Click Horror</strong> where critical thinking and strategy will help you solidify your survival.\u00a0Your mission: You must navigate through a dark cave featuring a unique <strong>6x6 grid map system</strong> to find and kill the yeti. Explore the cave and avoid dangers while using the limited resources to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509660/extras/2ccea4de5f0c36b2eb40a39e4787caca.poster.avif?t=1741117988\" width=800 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509660/extras/2ccea4de5f0c36b2eb40a39e4787caca.webm?t=1741117988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509660/extras/2ccea4de5f0c36b2eb40a39e4787caca.mp4?t=1741117988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric 2.5D Point-and-Click experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dark cave with a 6x6 grid system with only a limited light source</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely randomized experiences and locations every run to keep the game fresh</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game time is limited to 5 minutes to emphasize strategy whilst under pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And many more features to come</strong>, like a speed run timer to save your best hunting times!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CAN YOU HUNT THE YETI BEFORE IT HUNTS YOU?</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Trapped alone in the dark. Armed with a single spear, you have only 5 minutes. Can you hunt the Yeti before it hunts you?",
